  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Melee Attack. You lose 1 Dervish enchantment and gain 10...42...50 Health. If an enchantment is lost in this way, you cannot be blocked, you strike twice, and you gain an additional 10...58...70 Health.",
      "zhTW": "移除自身一項神喚使加持，獲得 10～50 體力，若移除成功，此技能無法被格檔且你攻擊兩次，再獲得 10～70 體力。"
    },
    "pvp": {
      "en": "Melee Attack. You lose 1 Dervish enchantment and gain 10...18...20 Health. If an enchantment is lost in this way, you cannot be blocked, you strike twice, with each strike doing 25% less damage than normal, and you gain an additional 10...26...30 Health.",
      "zhTW": "移除自身一項神喚使加持，獲得 10～20 體力，若移除成功，此技能無法被格檔且你攻擊兩次，再獲得 10～30 體力。"
    }
  },
